{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "I get asked a lot about what it takes to break into the Ruby on Rails industry at the various hackathons and start up weekends I have attended.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9caa842043f9a5932fd6cb3911a06888a3e9577a940a0d87860dd919689ffe86.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.2], [5, 1.2, 1.46], [6, 1.46, 1.72], [7, 1.72, 1.86], [8, 1.86, 2.12], [9, 2.12, 2.38], [10, 2.38, 2.56], [11, 2.56, 2.84], [12, 2.84, 2.96], [13, 2.96, 3.16], [14, 3.16, 3.36], [15, 3.36, 3.58], [16, 3.58, 4.14], [17, 4.14, 4.36], [18, 4.36, 4.48], [19, 4.48, 4.8], [20, 4.8, 5.62], [22, 6.02, 6.26], [24, 6.46, 6.78], [25, 6.78, 7.16], [26, 7.16, 7.3], [27, 7.3, 7.64]]}, {"text": "Spurred by this /r/ruby question.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/157443f1c2c059bcbc021b5899ef9ffe90d6a1b5f20bda895bf598a6f87930a1.mp3"}, {"text": "I shall try my best to answer this question in a public setting.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d0a0c1aef43bf11d6a2eae00d59429cb6c8b518f3f6e5bcc9aa5806480f89b1e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.5], [3, 0.5, 0.62], [4, 0.62, 0.82], [5, 0.82, 1.02], [6, 1.02, 1.26], [7, 1.26, 1.48], [8, 1.48, 1.82], [9, 1.82, 2.0], [10, 2.0, 2.08], [11, 2.08, 2.34], [12, 2.34, 2.66]]}, {"text": "I want to this in an entry level rails developer", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/82562b88177dd991ce442636af3d4798cc21aeafea7ce650664c27be8f815509.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [3, 0.4, 0.62], [4, 0.62, 0.74], [5, 0.74, 0.84], [6, 0.84, 1.1], [7, 1.1, 1.4], [8, 1.4, 1.72], [9, 1.72, 2.24]]}, {"text": "Build a CRUDL application", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/135af830a81cca8cb600b5c7350cb2de217f9b903027ec29c5fd0e237f91e99a.mp3"}, {"text": "Understand and apply bootstrap", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/797aa1f5e4b2772d6263ed1c0cac58c39586425b31607d171e619ef92fdc6cf4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.54], [1, 0.54, 0.86], [2, 0.86, 1.2], [3, 1.2, 1.96]]}, {"text": "Build a to-do application or any simple super basic app that requires a few controllers, models, etc.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c00fa4e853da104fc089ab469726d2d9255b2a81a09de0f8b4b7493b40472841.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [3, 0.6, 1.24], [4, 1.24, 1.54], [5, 1.54, 1.76], [6, 1.76, 2.14], [7, 2.14, 2.44], [8, 2.44, 2.78], [9, 2.78, 3.12], [10, 3.12, 3.32], [11, 3.32, 3.68], [12, 3.68, 3.88], [13, 3.88, 4.02], [14, 4.02, 4.5], [15, 4.86, 5.08], [16, 5.34, 5.54]]}, {"text": "Use slightly obscure gems, like the twitter, koala, mandrill, kaminari, jbuilder, etc. to prove to me that they can read the documentation and figure out how to use a gem.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2692135a92ab4f8554a197d5994d83c62598c9b6d415c860c5c27432a1272df6.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.18, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.9], [3, 0.9, 1.28], [4, 1.28, 1.56], [5, 1.56, 1.74], [6, 1.74, 1.98], [7, 2.34, 2.68], [11, 5.34, 5.66], [12, 6.3, 6.36], [13, 6.36, 6.6], [14, 6.6, 6.8], [15, 6.8, 6.9], [16, 6.9, 7.06], [17, 7.06, 7.22], [18, 7.22, 7.36], [19, 7.36, 7.52], [20, 7.52, 7.64], [21, 7.64, 8.2], [22, 8.2, 8.6], [23, 8.6, 8.84], [24, 8.84, 9.04], [25, 9.04, 9.2], [26, 9.2, 9.28], [27, 9.28, 9.44], [28, 9.44, 9.54], [29, 9.54, 9.76]]}, {"text": "Bonuses", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f02fbb6bd2b843aeb7ed76ef9fcb592960501a0a5755ebc5794da7e324eb1ade.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.48]]}, {"text": "Understanding a testing framework (rspec is my preference)", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5b5acd6de29570e96b7a9be0accf0e96a3f4bf6518263d619e04e1e8c81a8a50.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.54], [1, 0.54, 0.72], [2, 0.72, 1.02], [3, 1.02, 1.46], [5, 1.98, 2.22], [6, 2.22, 2.34], [7, 2.34, 2.74]]}, {"text": "Knowing some basic javascript (jquery)", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6ce98f63e14032aa30e2b3c33a327e5b3cebf2e12ed352ee4184cfeb623ac370.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 0.96], [3, 0.96, 1.5]]}, {"text": "Know TDD", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6a4e9236ad516d689fd5b8a25be9f7ca9ae2e888671d75599401adac9cb3bbc5.mp3"}, {"text": "Knowing Thin Controllers, Fat Models", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1134ffb2bd6d4cb5456e2933296092051cee996d395e42ad03383f2f27dfd042.mp3"}, {"text": "Attends the local ruby on rails meetup", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a9b09f2502eb5f99ec747cd99da02010df33d3c4c0d15a7b14943f7747c5ba61.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.48], [1, 0.48, 0.66], [2, 0.66, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.3], [4, 1.3, 1.6], [5, 1.6, 1.88], [6, 1.88, 2.48]]}]}